## HR Round Questions (separate, non-technical)

Tell me about yourself.
Why do you want to work in cyber security?
Why should we hire you for this role?
What are your strengths and weaknesses?
Where do you see yourself in five years?
How do you handle pressure or tight deadlines?
Describe a time you worked in a team to solve a problem.
Why did you choose this company?
What motivates you to keep learning in this field?
How do you stay updated with the latest security trends?
Are you willing to work in rotational shifts if required?
What are your salary expectations?
Describe a situation where you failed and what you learned from it.
How do you prioritize tasks when handling multiple incidents?
What do you know about our company and its security posture?

